OL,3,GNEWSA'Inflatable boat firm bust' and
OL,4,A'vandalism shuts folly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly round up of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local websites in the West
OL,8,Fof England.
OL,10,FA Somerset maker of specialist
OL,11,Finflatable boats that were used in the
OL,12,FLondon Olympics is to be liquidated
OL,13,Fwith the loss of 18 jobs, according to
OL,14,FSomerset Live. Ribcraft was founded in
OL,15,FYeovil in 1993 and the company's rigid
OL,16,Finflatable boats (RIBS) are also used
OL,17,Fby the police, the military and
OL,18,Femergency response teams across the
OL,19,Fworld.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
