OL,3,GNEWSA'Inflatable boat firm bust' and
OL,4,A'vandalism shuts folly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol Live reported on a car which
OL,7,Fcrashed into a house in Lockleaze and a
OL,8,Fpolice officer being injured by another
OL,9,Fcar which crashed into multiple
OL,10,Femergency vehicles.
OL,12,FThe popular landmark Browne's Folly -
OL,13,Fknown locally as The Pepperpot - in
OL,14,FMonkton Farleigh, Wiltshire, has been
OL,15,Fsealed shut by the owners due to its
OL,16,Fdecline and "persistent vandalism".
OL,17,FLocal volunteers have started a project
OL,18,Fto restore the Grade-II listed
OL,19,FVictorian tower.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
